:: MP Region Foghorn Pier Chain [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpSeenScenes to ($mpSeenScenes or {})>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Foghorn Pier Chain"] to 1>><<set $mpFogChainDone to ($mpFogChainDone or {})>><<if $mpFogLamp is undefined>><<set $mpFogLamp to 2>><</if>><<set $mpFogLamp to Math.clamp($mpFogLamp, 0, 5)>>
退潮的雾角栈桥下露出第三根系船石柱，覆满牡蛎壳的铁梯贴着断崖通往半山腰的守塔人旧居。海风卷着咸湿浪沫拍打桥桩，上方石屋的橡木窗板半掩着。<<if ($mpFogLamp or 0) lte 0>>手里的防风灯已经断油，暗槽里的锈蚀铁梯只剩模糊轮廓。<<else>>防风灯照亮了石阶暗槽里一串与旧港一致的钢印编号。<</if>><<if ($mpFogDepth or 0) gte 2>>海雾已在身后合拢，你这趟走得太深，退路正被涨潮吞没。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回雾角池 (0:03)|MP Region Pool Foghorn]]>><<pass 3>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>>
<<mpropeicon>><<link [[攀铁梯上石屋 (0:06)|MP Region Foghorn Keeper Cabin]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpFogDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpFogDepth or 0) + 1)>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<mpdiveicon>><<link [[攀湿滑铁梯上屋 (0:06)|MP Region Foghorn Pier Slip]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpFogDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpFogDepth or 0) + 1)>><<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<lowerwet 30>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[顺防波石阶回海岛 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><</link>>

:: MP Region Foghorn Pier Slip [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
脚下的锈蚀铁梯被海藻裹得极滑，你刚借力往上攀了半截，一排牡蛎壳骤然崩落。手掌在湿冷的石棱上擦破了皮，整个人跌回防波石阶下的浅水坑里，冰凉的海水瞬间浸透了裤脚。<<if ($mpFogLamp or 0) lte 0>>灯罩里没有半点星火，你在浓雾里摸索了半晌才扶住桥桩。<<else>>你护住晃动的防风灯，勉强在乱石间站稳脚跟。<</if>><<if ($mpFogAlert or 0) gte 6>>引桥上方传来巡夜人急促的喝问声，探照光柱正贴着水面扫来。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[沿引桥原路退 (0:05)|MP Region Pool Foghorn]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><<stress 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpsneakicon>><<link [[踩桥底暗桩险渡 (0:07)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><<tiredness 2>><<stress 3>><</link>>

:: MP Region Foghorn Keeper Cabin [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFogChainDone to ($mpFogChainDone or {})>>
推开守塔旧居厚重的木门，石砌壁炉隔绝了外海的呼啸。炉台边摆着一只鲸油铜罐，窗台气压计下压着泛黄的潮汐手札，床底还塞着一只带铜锁的帆布箱。<<if $mpFogChainDone["pier"]>>屋里的可用物已被你搜检过一轮，炉膛余烬微凉，只剩窗外海鸥掠过雾气的声响。<<else>>趁巡岛人还没回来，你可以从屋里带走一样趁手的东西，但撬动床底铜锁会惊动外头的耳目。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回雾角池 (0:04)|MP Region Pool Foghorn]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<if !$mpFogChainDone["pier"]>>
<<mplampicon>><<link [[灌取防风灯油 (0:06)|MP Region Foghorn Keeper Exit]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpFogPierPick to "oil">><<set $mpFogLoot_Oil to 1>><<set $mpFogLamp to Math.min(5, ($mpFogLamp or 0) + 2)>><<stress -2>><<set $mpFogChainDone["pier"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<mplockpickicon>><<link [[撬锁取走旧铜钥 (0:08)|MP Region Foghorn Keeper Exit]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpFogPierPick to "key">><<set $mpFogAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpFogAlert or 0) + 2)>><<set $mpFogOldKey to 1>><<skulduggery 2>><<stress -2>><<set $mpFogChainDone["pier"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpmapicon>><<link [[收好窗台潮汐手札 (0:06)|MP Region Foghorn Keeper Exit]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpFogPierPick to "chart">><<set $mpFogTideChart to 1>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["foghorn_tide_chart"] to 1>><<stress -2>><<set $mpFogChainDone["pier"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[退回海岛 (0:05)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><</link>>

:: MP Region Foghorn Keeper Exit [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你轻轻掩上守塔旧居厚重的橡木门，外海翻涌的冷雾顺着断崖石阶扑面而来，面前分出栈桥与后窗排水槽两条下撤去路。<<if $mpFogPierPick is "oil">>防风灯壶添足了鲸油，暖黄光晕驱散了寒意。<<elseif $mpFogPierPick is "key">>怀里揣着帆布箱取出的旧铜钥，锁扣余音未散。<<else>>衣袋里收好了泛黄的潮汐手札，退潮时刻已记在心头。<</if>><<if ($mpFogLamp or 0) lte 0>>此刻灯油见底，台阶黑得不见五指。<<elseif ($upperwet or 0) gte 30 or ($lowerwet or 0) gte 30>>湿冷衣摆贴着小腿，海风吹得人发颤。<</if>><<if ($mpFogAlert or 0) gte 6>>栈桥口晃来两盏风灯，巡夜守卫正拦人盘问。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[沿栈桥原路回 (0:05)|MP Region Pool Foghorn]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><<if ($mpFogAlert or 0) gte 6>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<set $mpFogAlert to Math.max(0, ($mpFogAlert or 0) - 1)>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpropeicon>><<link [[顺后窗排水槽下撤 (0:07)|MP Region Pool Foghorn]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><<tiredness 2>><<if ($mpFogLamp or 0) lte 0>><<pain 2>><<stress 3>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[径直回海岛 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><</link>>

:: MP Region Foghorn Wreck Chain [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpSeenScenes to ($mpSeenScenes or {})>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Foghorn Wreck Chain"] to 1>><<set $mpFogChainDone to ($mpFogChainDone or {})>>
断桅沉船滩外侧的黑色暗礁半浸在白沫里，早年触礁商船的橡木肋骨斜插在浅水区，底舱裂缝随涌浪一开一合。<<if $mpFogTideChart>>借着旧居带出的潮汐手札，你看准了两波涌浪之间的退潮空当。<<else>>暗流在礁盘缝隙间急速打旋，没摸清潮位很容易被卷进礁沟。<</if>><<if ($mpFogDepth or 0) gte 2>>雾气越聚越浓，你已走入外礁深处，浪声几乎盖过了呼吸。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回雾角池 (0:03)|MP Region Pool Foghorn]]>><<pass 3>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 260 or ($athletics or 0) gte 280 or $mpFogTideChart>>
<<mpswimicon>><<link [[涉过暗流进舱 (0:07)|MP Region Foghorn Wreck Hold]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpFogDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpFogDepth or 0) + 1)>><<set $mpFogLamp to Math.max(0, ($mpFogLamp or 0) - 1)>><<lowerwet 20>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<mpdiveicon>><<link [[顶着涌浪强行涉渡 (0:07)|MP Region Foghorn Wreck Undertow]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpFogDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpFogDepth or 0) + 1)>><<upperwet 40>><<lowerwet 50>><<pain 2>><<stress 5>><<tiredness 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[沿卵石滩回海岛 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><</link>>

:: MP Region Foghorn Wreck Undertow [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
一股暗流猛地漫过礁盘，你脚下一空，整个人被冰冷刺骨的浪头拍在腐朽的横桅上。咸涩的海水灌进领口，等你扒住挂满藤壶的礁石爬上浅滩时，全身衣衫都已湿透。<<if ($mpFogLamp or 0) lte 0>>防风灯在漆黑的礁滩上毫无光亮，你只能听着浪声辨认岸阶方向。<<else>>灯罩被浪花溅得滋滋作响，火苗勉强还剩一线微光。<</if>><<if ($mpFogAlert or 0) gte 6>>礁石上方传来巡逻艇低沉的汽笛声，探照灯光正往浅滩逼近。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[顺退潮滩退回 (0:05)|MP Region Pool Foghorn]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><<stress 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpclimbicon>><<link [[攀湿滑礁脊险路走 (0:07)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><<pain 1>><<tiredness 2>><</link>>

:: MP Region Foghorn Wreck Hold [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFogChainDone to ($mpFogChainDone or {})>>
钻进倾斜的商船底舱，幽暗的舱壁散发着陈年海泥与铁锈味。肋木深处卡着一只沉重的压舱铜匣，搬动时会发出闷响并拖慢回程脚步；舷窗架上则夹着一卷轻便的油布航志。<<if $mpFogChainDone["wreck"]>>底舱里的铜匣与航志都已被你动过，只剩潮水在空船壳里来回拍打。<<elseif ($mpFogLamp or 0) lte 0>>灯油已经烧干，舱内一片漆黑，摸索重物格外费力。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[空手退回池口 (0:04)|MP Region Pool Foghorn]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<if !$mpFogChainDone["wreck"]>>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[扛走沉重压舱铜匣 (0:09)|MP Region Foghorn Wreck Exit]]>><<pass 9>><<set $mpFogWreckPick to "heavy">><<set $mpFogAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpFogAlert or 0) + 3)>><<tiredness 3>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("foghorn_chain_wreck_heavy")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><<money 350>><<stress -2>><</if>><<set $mpFogChainDone["wreck"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpreadicon>><<link [[取走轻便油布卷 (0:06)|MP Region Foghorn Wreck Exit]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpFogWreckPick to "light">><<set $mpFogAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpFogAlert or 0) + 1)>><<if !$mpFogWreckLog>><<set $mpFogWreckLog to 1>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["foghorn_wreck_log"] to 1>><<stress -3>><<willpower 1>><</if>><<set $mpFogChainDone["wreck"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[撤出船壳 (0:05)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><</link>>

:: MP Region Foghorn Wreck Exit [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
外礁冰冷的潮水正顺着黑色礁沟飞快上涨，白沫不断拍打着倾斜的商船残骸，你必须在退潮浅滩与断桅横木之间选定撤离路线。<<if $mpFogWreckPick is "heavy">>你扛着沉重的压舱铜匣钻出船壳，靴底在湿沙里越陷越深。<<else>>你将轻便的油布卷贴身收好，利落地翻出倾斜舷窗。<</if>><<if ($mpFogLamp or 0) lte 0>>手里灯油已尽，礁滩方位全凭脚底深浅判断。<<elseif ($upperwet or 0) gte 30 or ($lowerwet or 0) gte 30>>湿透的衣裤裹着海风，每走一步都透着寒意。<</if>><<if ($mpFogAlert or 0) gte 6>>岸阶旁亮起巡夜火把，港口稽查正沿滩盘问。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[顺浅滩原路回 (0:06)|MP Region Pool Foghorn]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><<if $mpFogWreckPick is "heavy">><<tiredness 2>><<stress 2>><</if>><<if ($mpFogAlert or 0) gte 6>><<stress 3>><<set $mpFogAlert to Math.max(0, ($mpFogAlert or 0) - 1)>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpswimicon>><<link [[踩断桅横木险路渡 (0:08)|MP Region Pool Foghorn]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><<if $mpFogWreckPick is "heavy" or ($mpFogLamp or 0) lte 0>><<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<lowerwet 25>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[撤回雾角岛 (0:05)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><</link>>

:: MP Region Foghorn Tower Chain [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpSeenScenes to ($mpSeenScenes or {})>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Foghorn Tower Chain"] to 1>><<set $mpFogChainDone to ($mpFogChainDone or {})>>
推开灯塔底座的铸铁窄门，盘旋而上的铁梯没入浓稠的黑暗，防风灯的火苗被穿堂风压低了一截。头顶透镜室漏下一缕极淡的微光，中段几级铸铁踏板早已锈穿。<<if ($mpFogLamp or 0) lte 0>>灯壶里的油已经烧干，四周伸手不见五指，摸黑攀登极易踏空。<<else>>昏黄的灯火照出踏板缺口与扶手上的旧铜链。<</if>><<if ($mpFogDepth or 0) gte 2>>你已深入塔身腹地，下方的潮声变得沉闷遥远。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回雾角池 (0:03)|MP Region Pool Foghorn]]>><<pass 3>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<if (($mpFogLamp or 0) gte 1 and (($willpower or 0) gte 340 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240)) or (($willpower or 0) gte 540 and ($athletics or 0) gte 360)>>
<<mplampicon>><<link [[举灯攀上灯室 (0:07)|MP Region Foghorn Lantern Room]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpFogDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpFogDepth or 0) + 1)>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<mpclimbicon>><<link [[摸黑强登铸铁梯 (0:07)|MP Region Foghorn Tower Dark]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpFogDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpFogDepth or 0) + 1)>><<set $mpFogAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpFogAlert or 0) + 2)>><<pain 3>><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[出塔门返回雾角岛 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><</link>>

:: MP Region Foghorn Tower Dark [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你在幽暗的旋梯中段一脚踏进锈穿的空档，小腿重重磕在铸铁横梁上。断裂的铁板坠落塔底，在空旷的塔筒里激起一串刺耳的金属回响，惊得塔外海鸟四散飞起。<<if ($mpFogLamp or 0) lte 0>>由于没有灯油照明，你只能贴着冰冷的砖墙摸索下撤。<<else>>你慌忙扶住摇晃的灯罩，没敢再往上硬闯。<</if>><<if ($mpFogAlert or 0) gte 6>>塔门外已响起巡夜人的脚步与急促的哨声。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[顺旋梯原路退 (0:05)|MP Region Pool Foghorn]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><<stress 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpropeicon>><<link [[钻塔身通风窗险撤 (0:07)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><<pain 1>><<tiredness 2>><</link>>

:: MP Region Foghorn Lantern Room [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFogChainDone to ($mpFogChainDone or {})>>
塔顶灯室四周环绕着巨大的弧形玻璃透镜，中央铜灯座里的主灯芯浸在余油中，窗外整片雾潮海湾尽收眼底。<<if $mpFogOldKey>>你用旧居取来的铜钥顺利拧开了灯座侧柜。<<else>>灯座侧柜挂着暗锁，强行拨开锁簧在寂静里发出一声轻响。<</if>><<if $mpFogChainDone["tower"]>>灯室里的机关已被你处置过，铜镜面映着外海沉浮的雾气。<<else>>你可以拨亮主灯为外海引航，也可以让灯室保持黑暗、只拓下底座的暗记。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回雾角池 (0:04)|MP Region Pool Foghorn]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<if !$mpFogChainDone["tower"]>>
<<mplampicon>><<link [[拨亮主航标灯 (0:08)|MP Region Foghorn Tower Exit]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpFogTowerPick to "light">><<set $mpFogAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpFogAlert or 0) + 3)>><<if !$mpFogBeaconLit>><<set $mpFogBeaconLit to 1>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["foghorn_beacon_lit"] to 1>><<stress -4>><<willpower 2>><</if>><<set $mpFogChainDone["tower"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpsneakicon>><<link [[保持黑暗拓下暗记 (0:08)|MP Region Foghorn Tower Exit]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpFogTowerPick to "dark">><<if !$mpFogOldKey>><<set $mpFogAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpFogAlert or 0) + 1)><</if>><<if !$mpFogLensMark>><<set $mpFogLensMark to 1>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["foghorn_lens_mark"] to 1>><<skulduggery 2>><<stress -3>><</if>><<set $mpFogChainDone["tower"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[沿旋梯下塔回岛 (0:05)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><</link>>

:: MP Region Foghorn Tower Exit [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
海风在塔顶透镜室外呼啸盘旋，铸铁旋梯与外墙避雷索分别通向塔底，你得趁早动身下塔。<<if $mpFogTowerPick is "light">>透镜将橘黄光柱投向外海照亮水道，却也引来了岸上巡夜人的注意。<<else>>你借着夜色拓下铜座内侧的航标暗记，外海依旧笼罩在浓雾里。<</if>><<if ($mpFogLamp or 0) lte 0>>下塔时手头已无灯油，只能扶着铁栏摸黑下行。<<elseif ($upperwet or 0) gte 30 or ($lowerwet or 0) gte 30>>穿堂风吹过湿冷衣衫，让你打了个寒颤。<</if>><<if ($mpFogAlert or 0) gte 6>>塔底门口聚起火把光亮，守卫正守在出口盘查。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[沿旋梯原路下 (0:05)|MP Region Pool Foghorn]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><<if ($mpFogAlert or 0) gte 6>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<set $mpFogAlert to Math.max(0, ($mpFogAlert or 0) - 1)>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpropeicon>><<link [[顺外墙避雷索滑下 (0:07)|MP Region Pool Foghorn]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><<tiredness 2>><<if ($mpFogLamp or 0) lte 0>><<pain 2>><<stress 3>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[直接回海岛 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><</link>>

:: MP Region Foghorn Echo Chain [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpSeenScenes to ($mpSeenScenes or {})>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Foghorn Echo Chain"] to 1>><<set $mpFogChainDone to ($mpFogChainDone or {})>>
海蚀回音廊的天然石拱蜿蜒深入崖底，穿堂风掠过盐晶孔洞，激起管风琴般的重叠低鸣，灯火在湿冷的石壁上晃成一团。石壁上留着早年守塔人刻下的引路记号，北壁气孔下还挂着风干的海星标本。<<if ($mpFogLamp or 0) lte 0>>灯油已尽，幽暗的石拱里只剩忽远忽近的潮音，极易听错方位。<<else>>灯影映出石壁刻痕的走向。<</if>><<if ($mpFogDepth or 0) gte 2>>你已走到崖底最深处，潮水正漫上廊口石阶。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回雾角池 (0:03)|MP Region Pool Foghorn]]>><<pass 3>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<if (($mpFogLamp or 0) gte 1 and (($history or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 400)) or (($history or 0) gte 380 and ($willpower or 0) gte 520)>>
<<mpeavesdropicon>><<link [[辨听石壁旧音 (0:07)|MP Region Foghorn Echo Relic]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpFogDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpFogDepth or 0) + 1)>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<mpbellicon>><<link [[循着杂乱回音硬闯 (0:07)|MP Region Foghorn Echo Lost]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpFogDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpFogDepth or 0) + 1)>><<lowerwet 30>><<pain 1>><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<if ($mpFogLamp or 0) gte 1>><<mpdiveicon>><<link [[摸进北壁海星龛 (0:05)|MP Region Foghorn StarfishBronzeKey]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpFogLamp to Math.max(0, ($mpFogLamp or 0) - 1)>><<set $mpFogAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpFogAlert or 0) + 1)>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">摸进北壁海星龛 (0:05)（灯油不足）</span><</if>>

:: MP Region Foghorn Echo Lost [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
层层叠叠的空灵回音在耳畔打转，你把风吹盲洞的呜咽当成了引路声，一脚踏进涨潮的环形石洼。咸冷的海水漫过膝弯，尖锐的盐晶擦破了手背，等好不容易摸回主拱道时已是满头冷汗。<<if ($mpFogLamp or 0) lte 0>>四周漆黑一片，你只能贴着潮湿的石壁摸索退路。<<else>>你把防风灯举高，避开再次漫上来的水线。<</if>><<if ($mpFogAlert or 0) gte 6>>廊口方向传来巡夜守卫的呼哨声，回音将喝问声放得极大。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[顺主拱道退回 (0:05)|MP Region Pool Foghorn]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><<stress 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpswimicon>><<link [[潜过侧壁潮汐洞走 (0:07)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><<lowerwet 20>><<tiredness 2>><</link>>

:: MP Region Foghorn Echo Relic [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFogChainDone to ($mpFogChainDone or {})>>
穿过共鸣最稳的石拱，尽头高出潮水线的干龛里摆着一只油布包裹。打开一看，是一块停摆的守塔人铜怀表、半册值夜遗记与几枚旧港银币。遗记末页写着老守塔人的嘱托：若后继者寻来，愿将怀表留在龛中作信。<<if $mpFogChainDone["echo"]>>石龛里的遗物已经由你处置妥当，盐晶折射着幽微的光。<<else>>你可以把遗物留在龛中并添上记号，也可以将整包旧物装袋带走。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回雾角池 (0:04)|MP Region Pool Foghorn]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<if !$mpFogChainDone["echo"]>>
<<mphearticon>><<link [[留给后继守塔 (0:07)|MP Region Foghorn Echo Exit]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpFogEchoPick to "leave">><<set $mpFogAlert to Math.max(0, ($mpFogAlert or 0) - 1)>><<if !$mpFogRelicChoice>><<set $mpFogRelicChoice to "leave">><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["foghorn_relic_honored"] to 1>><<stress -5>><<willpower 2>><</if>><<set $mpFogChainDone["echo"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[将守塔人遗物带走 (0:07)|MP Region Foghorn Echo Exit]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpFogEchoPick to "take">><<set $mpFogAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpFogAlert or 0) + 2)>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("foghorn_chain_echo_relic")>><<set $mpFogRelicChoice to "take">><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><<money 400>><<stress -2>><</if>><<set $mpFogChainDone["echo"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[循石拱撤出回岛 (0:05)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><</link>>

:: MP Region Foghorn Echo Exit [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
崖底的潮音在石拱间来回激荡，水线正一点点漫上回音廊石阶，主拱道与绝壁铜链都能离开。<<if $mpFogEchoPick is "leave">>你将油布折好压回石龛深处，只记下遗记里的暗礁航线。<<else>>你把沉甸甸的铜怀表与旧银币揣进怀里，链环发出一声轻响。<</if>><<if ($mpFogLamp or 0) lte 0>>回程时灯油已尽，只能借着水洼反光摸向出口。<<elseif ($upperwet or 0) gte 30 or ($lowerwet or 0) gte 30>>湿冷裤脚不断滴水，脚踝被海风吹得生疼。<</if>><<if ($mpFogAlert or 0) gte 6>>回音廊出口立着提灯守卫，正盘查出廊的人影。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[顺石拱原路回 (0:05)|MP Region Pool Foghorn]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><<if ($mpFogAlert or 0) gte 6>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<set $mpFogAlert to Math.max(0, ($mpFogAlert or 0) - 1)>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpclimbicon>><<link [[攀绝壁铜链险路出 (0:07)|MP Region Pool Foghorn]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><<tiredness 2>><<if ($mpFogLamp or 0) lte 0>><<pain 2>><<stress 3>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回雾角岛 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><</link>>

:: MP Region Clockwork Escapement Chain [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpSeenScenes to ($mpSeenScenes or {})>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Clockwork Escapement Chain"] to 1>><<set $mpClockChainDone to ($mpClockChainDone or {})>><<if $mpClockLamp is undefined>><<set $mpClockLamp to 2>><</if>><<set $mpClockLamp to Math.clamp($mpClockLamp, 0, 5)>>
齿圈外沿那扇铸铁门只装了一副单向棘爪，推开时咔的一声咬死，再想回头已经抵不动半寸。门后是两米高的主擒纵轮，每三秒砸下一记闷响，轮辐甩起的油星溅在靴面上。真正能出去的路在轮轴另一侧，一架检修梯贴着墙往下走，梯口悬着一根系铃的铜链。<<if ($mpClockLamp or 0) lte 0>>门洞里的风裹着铁锈味，你只能凭齿声判断轮辐转到了哪一格。<<else>>油灯只照出三尺远，齿圈的阴影仍深得像口井。<</if>><<if ($mpClockDepth or 0) gte 2>>你已经贴到轮轴内缘，震动能从牙根一直麻到指尖。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[观察轮轴间隙 (0:09)|MP Region Clockwork Escapement Axle]]>><<pass 9>><<set $mpClockLamp to Math.max(0, ($mpClockLamp or 0) - 1)>><<set $mpClockDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpClockDepth or 0) + 1)>><<set $mpClockAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpClockAlert or 0) + 1)>><<set $mpClockEscSeen to 1>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[卡准间隙穿轮廊 (0:06)|MP Region Clockwork Escapement Axle]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpClockDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpClockDepth or 0) + 1)>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<mpdiveicon>><<link [[钻过轮辐 (0:06)|MP Region Clockwork Escapement Slip]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpClockDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpClockDepth or 0) + 1)>><<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<lowerwet 30>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Clockwork Escapement Slip [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
格栅上积了不知多少年的机油，像一层活物。你刚把重心挪到左脚，鞋底便整片滑开，手肘撞上铜管法兰，人顺着缝隙漏进下方的接油浅槽，废油一直漫到膝弯。身后的单向棘爪咬得死紧，原路是回不去了；头顶的轮辐照旧三秒一撞，槽壁上的排油暗渠黑得望不见底。<<if ($mpClockLamp or 0) lte 0>>灯灭在油里，你摸到槽壁的铆钉才辨出方向。<<else>>你把灯举到油面之上，火苗被潮气逼得只剩一线。<</if>><<if ($mpClockAlert or 0) gte 6>>传声管里有人敲了两下，又停住，像是在听这边的水声。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[钻暗渠脱身 (0:07)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><<tiredness 2>><<stress 3>><<lowerwet 25>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpsneakicon>><<link [[贴槽壁摸黑爬出 (0:06)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><<tiredness 3>><<stress 2>><<lowerwet 20>><</link>>

:: MP Region Clockwork Escapement Axle [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClockChainDone to ($mpClockChainDone or {})>>
检修台嵌在擒纵轮内侧，铜壶里的精炼钟油还带着余温，接油盘边搁着一枚十字发条铜钥，仪表箱背板后塞着半卷手绘的管路图。轮辐每次掠过，台面都轻轻一跳。<<if $mpClockChainDone["escapement"]>>台上能拿的东西早被收走，只剩擒纵叉一起一落的脆响。<<elseif $mpClockEscSeen>>你先前数准了轮辐的空当，落脚时一点也不慌。<<else>>你没有细看节奏就闯了进来，轮辐擦着后背掠过，惊出一层冷汗。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[撤下检修梯 (0:05)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<if !$mpClockChainDone["escapement"]>>
<<mplampicon>><<link [[灌取精炼灯油 (0:06)|MP Region Clockwork Escapement Exit]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpClockEscPick to "oil">><<set $mpClockLoot_Oil to 1>><<set $mpClockLamp to Math.min(5, ($mpClockLamp or 0) + 2)>><<stress -2>><<set $mpClockChainDone["escapement"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<mplockpickicon>><<link [[拔出十字发条钥 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Escapement Exit]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpClockEscPick to "key">><<set $mpClockAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpClockAlert or 0) + 2)>><<set $mpClockWindKey to 1>><<skulduggery 2>><<stress -2>><<set $mpClockChainDone["escapement"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpmapicon>><<link [[收拢仪表管路图纸 (0:06)|MP Region Clockwork Escapement Exit]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpClockEscPick to "chart">><<set $mpClockPipeChart to 1>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["clockwork_pipe_chart"] to 1>><<stress -2>><<set $mpClockChainDone["escapement"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<else>>
<<link [[走轮廊下 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Clockwork Escapement Exit [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你从齿圈外侧的检修梯翻下来，脚底终于踩上不再震颤的石阶。回身看，那扇单向门藏在轮辐背后，合得严丝合缝，只有绕到这一侧才找得到下行的路。<<if $mpClockEscPick is "oil">>灯膛添了新油，火苗稳得能照见梯级上的锈斑。<<elseif $mpClockEscPick is "key">>铜钥贴着肋骨，走一步磕一下。<<else>>管路图折在衣襟里，纸角被汗浸软了。<</if>><<if ($mpClockLamp or 0) lte 0>>梯井底下是黑的，你数着铆钉往下挪。<<elseif ($upperwet or 0) gte 30 or ($lowerwet or 0) gte 30>>裤脚滴着油水，每一步都黏腻发沉。<</if>><<if ($mpClockAlert or 0) gte 6>>梯口上方有人提着灯来回走，光柱扫过铁栏。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[下检修梯回池 (0:05)|MP Region Pool Clockwork]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><<if ($mpClockAlert or 0) gte 6>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<set $mpClockAlert to Math.max(0, ($mpClockAlert or 0) - 1)>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpropeicon>><<link [[攀吊篮滑槽下撤 (0:07)|MP Region Pool Clockwork]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><<tiredness 2>><<if ($mpClockLamp or 0) lte 0>><<pain 2>><<stress 3>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回机括城 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><</link>>

:: MP Region Clockwork Steam Chain [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpSeenScenes to ($mpSeenScenes or {})>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Clockwork Steam Chain"] to 1>><<set $mpClockChainDone to ($mpClockChainDone or {})>>
三号紫铜锅炉的哨音一阵紧过一阵，压力表指针贴着红线打颤。往里去有两条路：西侧管廊钻进冷却塔腹地，铁皮管壁挡得住蒸汽，却照不进一点光；外壁的检修梯贴着塔身往上，风大、烫手，好处是绕开了管廊里积了半尺的冷凝水。<<if $mpClockPipeChart>>你怀里那张管路图正好标着两次排汽的间隔。<<else>>铜管接缝处没有标记，喷汽的节奏只能自己数。<</if>><<if ($mpClockDepth or 0) gte 2>>白雾已经漫到胸口，再往里就是冷却塔的腹地。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回机括池 (0:03)|MP Region Pool Clockwork]]>><<pass 3>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[走西侧管廊 (0:07)|MP Region Clockwork Steam Condenser]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpClockSteamRoute to "pipe">><<set $mpClockDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpClockDepth or 0) + 1)>><<set $mpClockLamp to Math.max(0, ($mpClockLamp or 0) - 1)>><<lowerwet 20>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpclimbicon>><<link [[攀冷却塔外壁 (0:06)|MP Region Clockwork Steam Condenser]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpClockSteamRoute to "wall">><<set $mpClockDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpClockDepth or 0) + 1)>><<set $mpClockAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpClockAlert or 0) + 2)>><<pain 2>><<tiredness 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpdiveicon>><<link [[顶着滚烫白雾闯 (0:07)|MP Region Clockwork Steam Scald]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpClockDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpClockDepth or 0) + 1)>><<upperwet 40>><<lowerwet 50>><<pain 2>><<stress 5>><<tiredness 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[撤下旋梯回机括城 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><</link>>

:: MP Region Clockwork Steam Scald [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
外壁第四级踏板忽然一沉，脚边的排汽阀正对着脸炸开。滚烫的白雾裹着水珠扑上来，你反手抓住扶手，掌心立刻红了一片。铁旋梯下方的冷凝水正哗哗地涌，回去的梯级被那股汽柱封死了，只能另找路。<<if ($mpClockLamp or 0) lte 0>>灯不知道掉在了哪一层，你贴着塔壁一点一点挪。<<else>>灯罩上全是水珠，火苗缩成黄豆大的一点。<</if>><<if ($mpClockAlert or 0) gte 6>>塔底的铜铃被风扯得乱响，巡检的脚步声正往这边来。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[绕塔基退回池 (0:06)|MP Region Pool Clockwork]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpclimbicon>><<link [[翻冷却风道撤离 (0:07)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><<pain 1>><<tiredness 2>><</link>>

:: MP Region Clockwork Steam Condenser [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClockChainDone to ($mpClockChainDone or {})>>
<<if $mpClockSteamRoute is "pipe">>你从管廊口钻出来，裤脚滴着冷凝水，池沿的栏杆正好借力。<<else>>你顺着外壁铁梯翻进塔腹，人还挂在半空就看见了池底的铅盒，只是要够到表盘那一侧，得绕过大半个水池。<</if>>池底沉着箍铁皮的密封铅盒，碎裂的温度计表盘后塞着一只轻便防水铜筒。<<if $mpClockChainDone["steam"]>>两样东西都被人动过，只剩水泡咕嘟往上冒。<<elseif ($mpClockLamp or 0) lte 0>>灯芯只剩一点红，池底的东西全靠手摸。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收手退回池 (0:04)|MP Region Pool Clockwork]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<if !$mpClockChainDone["steam"]>>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[拖捞沉底铅盒 (0:09)|MP Region Clockwork Steam Exit]]>><<pass 9>><<set $mpClockSteamPick to "heavy">><<if $mpClockSteamRoute is "pipe">><<set $mpClockAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpClockAlert or 0) + 3)>><<tiredness 3>><<else>><<set $mpClockAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpClockAlert or 0) + 2)>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("clockwork_chain_steam_heavy")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><<money 350>><<stress -2>><</if>><<set $mpClockChainDone["steam"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpreadicon>><<link [[抽走表盘防水筒 (0:06)|MP Region Clockwork Steam Exit]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpClockSteamPick to "light">><<if $mpClockSteamRoute is "wall">><<set $mpClockAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpClockAlert or 0) + 2)>><<lowerwet 25>><<else>><<set $mpClockAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpClockAlert or 0) + 1)>><</if>><<if !$mpClockSteamLog>><<set $mpClockSteamLog to 1>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["clockwork_steam_log"] to 1>><<stress -3>><<willpower 1>><</if>><<set $mpClockChainDone["steam"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<</if>>
<<walkicon>><<link [[钻铜管撤出压力室 (0:05)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><</link>>

:: MP Region Clockwork Steam Exit [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
泄压阀的长鸣把整条通道震得发麻，白汽从每一道法兰缝里挤出来。你贴着管壁往外挪，铁旋梯和排污铜管在雾里各露出一截。<<if $mpClockSteamPick is "heavy">>怀里的铅盒坠得肩膀发酸，每一步都得先试稳了再落脚。<<else>>铜筒贴在衣袋里，隔着布料还能觉出一点凉。<</if>><<if ($mpClockLamp or 0) lte 0>>灯早熄了，你借着阀门口那点暗红辨路。<<elseif ($upperwet or 0) gte 30 or ($lowerwet or 0) gte 30>>湿透的衣衫被穿堂风一吹，冷得人缩起脖子。<</if>><<if ($mpClockAlert or 0) gte 6>>旋梯口亮着一盏风灯，有人正倚着栏杆往下看。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[下旋梯回池 (0:06)|MP Region Pool Clockwork]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><<if $mpClockSteamPick is "heavy">><<tiredness 2>><<stress 2>><</if>><<if ($mpClockAlert or 0) gte 6>><<stress 3>><<set $mpClockAlert to Math.max(0, ($mpClockAlert or 0) - 1)>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpswimicon>><<link [[钻排污管险渡 (0:08)|MP Region Pool Clockwork]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><<if $mpClockSteamPick is "heavy" or ($mpClockLamp or 0) lte 0>><<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<lowerwet 25>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回机括城 (0:05)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><</link>>

:: MP Region Clockwork Armillary Chain [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpSeenScenes to ($mpSeenScenes or {})>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Clockwork Armillary Chain"] to 1>><<set $mpClockChainDone to ($mpClockChainDone or {})>>
青铜侧门后是一间停摆的天文台，黄铜浑天仪斜挂在穹顶底下，主轴缠着断掉的发条钢带，石桌上散着十几片水晶磨片。台阶半腰坐着个值夜机匠，正就着灯修一只怀表，听见脚步也不抬头：“钥匙呢？没有钥匙就下台去，星象台夜里不接客。”<<if ($mpClockLamp or 0) lte 0>>灯早灭了，穹顶下只剩他那一小团光。<<else>>灯焰照过去，主轴凹槽里嵌着一颗夜明珠，正对天蝎座的方向。<</if>><<if ($mpClockDepth or 0) gte 2>>你已经绕到天文台内圈，脚下锅炉的轰鸣低得像远处的潮声。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回机括池 (0:03)|MP Region Pool Clockwork]]>><<pass 3>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpClockWindKey or (($mpClockLamp or 0) gte 1 and (($science or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 340)) or (($science or 0) gte 360 and ($willpower or 0) gte 540)>>
<<mpastroicon>><<link [[亮铜钥登台 (0:07)|MP Region Clockwork Armillary Bench]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpClockDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpClockDepth or 0) + 1)>><<set $mpClockArmEntry to "pass">><<tiredness 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<link [[报上名号求通融 (0:07)|MP Region Clockwork Armillary Dark]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpClockDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpClockDepth or 0) + 1)>><<set $mpClockAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpClockAlert or 0) + 1)>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<mpsneakicon>><<link [[摸黑上观测台 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Armillary Bench]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpClockDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpClockDepth or 0) + 1)>><<set $mpClockAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpClockAlert or 0) + 3)>><<set $mpClockArmEntry to "sneak">><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[绕侧门撤回机括城 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><</link>>

:: MP Region Clockwork Armillary Dark [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你刚踏上观测台的铁梯，值夜机匠就把怀表往桌上一扣，起身拦在梯口：“说了夜里不接客。”他一手提灯，一手推着你的肩，把你从台阶上赶下去，铜门在背后落了闩。台面上的星图还摊着，你却连边都碰不着。<<if ($mpClockLamp or 0) lte 0>>你连灯都没有，只能扶着栏杆一级级往下探。<<else>>灯被他顺手拨到一边，火苗歪得几乎立不住。<</if>><<if ($mpClockAlert or 0) gte 6>>楼上有人推开窗板问了一句，机匠回说只是野猫。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[下台阶退回池 (0:05)|MP Region Pool Clockwork]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpsneakicon>><<link [[绕老爷钟暗道走 (0:07)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><</link>>

:: MP Region Clockwork Armillary Bench [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClockChainDone to ($mpClockChainDone or {})>>
观测台是一整块石英砂盘，中央架着折光透镜组，扶手的夹层里塞着一叠彗星轨迹图，封口压着红蜡。<<if $mpClockArmEntry is "sneak">>台下传来机匠翻动工具的轻响，他没发现梯子上少了一个人。<<else>>机匠在台阶下嘟囔了一句，又低头摆弄怀表去了。<</if>><<if $mpClockWindKey>>十字发条铜钥正好卡住浑天仪的棘轮。<<else>>棘轮没有钥匙固定，拨动铜环时会带出一串细碎的齿轮声。<</if>><<if $mpClockChainDone["armillary"]>>台上的透镜和星图都动过了，穹顶只剩一点幽幽的珠光。<<else>>你可以校准透镜把光束投向密库门锁，也可以维持原样，只把星图拓下来。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回机括池 (0:04)|MP Region Pool Clockwork]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<if !$mpClockChainDone["armillary"]>>
<<mplampicon>><<link [[校准折光透镜组 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Armillary Exit]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpClockArmPick to "align">><<set $mpClockAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpClockAlert or 0) + 3)>><<if !$mpClockLensAligned>><<set $mpClockLensAligned to 1>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["clockwork_lens_aligned"] to 1>><<stress -4>><<willpower 2>><</if>><<set $mpClockChainDone["armillary"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpsneakicon>><<link [[拓下红蜡星图 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Armillary Exit]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpClockArmPick to "chart">><<if !$mpClockWindKey>><<set $mpClockAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpClockAlert or 0) + 1)>><</if>><<if !$mpClockCometChart>><<set $mpClockCometChart to 1>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["clockwork_comet_chart"] to 1>><<skulduggery 2>><<stress -3>><</if>><<set $mpClockChainDone["armillary"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<</if>>
<<walkicon>><<link [[摸下台阶返机括城 (0:05)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><</link>>

:: MP Region Clockwork Armillary Exit [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你退到穹顶下的回廊，正门石阶和老爷钟背后的通风道都能通回外层。<<if $mpClockArmPick is "align">>折光透镜把一束清冷的光斑投向密库防爆门，也惊动了外圈的巡检。<<else>>拓本折好，贴着胸口收进衣袋，浑天仪仍旧静默停摆。<</if>><<if ($mpClockLamp or 0) lte 0>>下台时灯已油尽，你扶着铜栏一级级摸索。<<elseif ($upperwet or 0) gte 30 or ($lowerwet or 0) gte 30>>湿冷的油污贴着小腿，穿堂风一吹直打颤。<</if>><<if ($mpClockAlert or 0) gte 6>>台阶下亮着一盏提灯，值夜机匠正和守卫说着什么。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[下石阶回池 (0:05)|MP Region Pool Clockwork]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><<if ($mpClockAlert or 0) gte 6>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<set $mpClockAlert to Math.max(0, ($mpClockAlert or 0) - 1)>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpropeicon>><<link [[滑配重链槽下 (0:07)|MP Region Pool Clockwork]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><<tiredness 2>><<if ($mpClockLamp or 0) lte 0>><<pain 2>><<stress 3>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回机括城 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><</link>>

:: MP Region Clockwork Vault Chain [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpSeenScenes to ($mpSeenScenes or {})>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Clockwork Vault Chain"] to 1>><<set $mpClockChainDone to ($mpClockChainDone or {})>>
档案馆密库的防爆门虚掩着，门框上缠着一圈铜制共振管，稍有异响便一路传到走廊尽头。十二只黑铁保险柜排成一路，最里侧的石台上卧着一台黄铜差分机。<<if ($mpClockAlert or 0) gte 6>>巡夜的步子一直没走远，铜管里全是回声，细巧的手法在这里已经使不出来。<<elseif ($mpClockLamp or 0) lte 0>>灯油见了底，转盘上的刻度只能靠指腹去摸。<</if>><<if ($mpClockDepth or 0) gte 2>>你已经走到密库最里层，门外的动静被厚钢板隔得干干净净。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回机括池 (0:03)|MP Region Pool Clockwork]]>><<pass 3>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($mpClockAlert or 0) lt 6>>
<<if (($mpClockLamp or 0) gte 1 and (($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 240)) or (($skulduggery or 0) gte 380 and ($history or 0) gte 360)>>
<<mplockpickicon>><<link [[拨开十二号柜 (0:07)|MP Region Clockwork Vault Safe]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpClockDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpClockDepth or 0) + 1)>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<mpsneakicon>><<link [[拨错暗簧 (0:07)|MP Region Clockwork Vault Alarm]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpClockDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpClockDepth or 0) + 1)>><<set $mpClockAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpClockAlert or 0) + 2)>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>
<</if>>
<<mpbellicon>><<link [[硬拧十二号转盘 (0:07)|MP Region Clockwork Vault Safe]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpClockDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpClockDepth or 0) + 1)>><<set $mpClockAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpClockAlert or 0) + 3)>><<pain 1>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[出防爆门返机括城 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><</link>>

:: MP Region Clockwork Vault Alarm [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
转盘里某根簧片弹脱，柜后的铜锤连着敲响共振管，整间密库瞬间被尖利的铃声灌满。门框上的铁闸轰然落下，把退路切成两半，灰尘从闸缝里簌簌往下掉。走廊尽头传来奔跑的皮靴声。<<if ($mpClockLamp or 0) lte 0>>黑暗里你只能摸到闸门冰凉的铁面，指缝全是锈屑。<<else>>灯火照着落下来的闸齿，一根根像倒悬的钉。<</if>><<if ($mpClockAlert or 0) gte 6>>脚步声在闸外停了一下，随即有人开始摇动绞盘。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[贴墙摸向排风槽 (0:07)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpsneakicon>><<link [[钻闸底缝隙过 (0:06)|MP Region Pool Clockwork]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<lowerwet 15>><</link>>

:: MP Region Clockwork Vault Safe [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClockChainDone to ($mpClockChainDone or {})>>
十二号柜门弹开，丝绒衬垫上躺着黄铜密码筒、一叠差分机穿孔卡片和几枚旧金镑。最上面那张卡片的扉页留着一行字，落款是初代总机匠：核心图纸不许带出地底。<<if $mpClockChainDone["vault"]>>柜里已被你收拾干净，只有绒布上还留着几道压痕。<<elseif ($mpClockLamp or 0) lte 0>>灯油告罄，卡片上的字迹糊成一团，只能凭手感分拣。<</if>><<if ($mpClockLamp or 0) gte 1 and !$mpClockChainDone["vault"]>>借着灯光，你看清了扉页的落款与编号。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回机括池 (0:04)|MP Region Pool Clockwork]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<if !$mpClockChainDone["vault"]>>
<<if ($mpClockLamp or 0) gte 1>>
<<mphearticon>><<link [[封回原件编号 (0:07)|MP Region Clockwork Vault Exit]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpClockVaultPick to "leave">><<set $mpClockAlert to Math.max(0, ($mpClockAlert or 0) - 1)>><<if !$mpClockVaultChoice>><<set $mpClockVaultChoice to "leave">><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["clockwork_vault_cipher"] to 1>><<stress -5>><<willpower 2>><</if>><<set $mpClockChainDone["vault"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<</if>>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[带走密码筒与金镑 (0:07)|MP Region Clockwork Vault Exit]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpClockVaultPick to "take">><<set $mpClockAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpClockAlert or 0) + 2)>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("clockwork_chain_vault_relic")>><<set $mpClockVaultChoice to "take">><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><<money 400>><<stress -2>><</if>><<set $mpClockChainDone["vault"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<</if>>
<<walkicon>><<link [[出密库回机括城 (0:05)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><</link>>

:: MP Region Clockwork Vault Exit [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
防爆门外的走廊比密库里更冷，排风管和主廊两头都通着机括城外围。<<if $mpClockVaultPick is "leave">>你把穿孔卡片原样锁回黑铁柜，只把差分机的核心编码记在心里。<<else>>密码筒和旧金镑压着衣襟，柜门合拢时发出一声轻响。<</if>><<if ($mpClockLamp or 0) lte 0>>回程没有灯，你贴着铁皮卷宗柜一路摸过去。<<elseif ($upperwet or 0) gte 30 or ($lowerwet or 0) gte 30>>湿冷的裤管磨着脚踝，地底阴风吹得人手脚发凉。<</if>><<if ($mpClockAlert or 0) gte 6>>门廊尽头站着一个提灯的人，正挨个拉开柜门查看。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[下防爆门回池 (0:05)|MP Region Pool Clockwork]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><<if ($mpClockAlert or 0) gte 6>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<set $mpClockAlert to Math.max(0, ($mpClockAlert or 0) - 1)>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpclimbicon>><<link [[攀排风管格栅出 (0:07)|MP Region Pool Clockwork]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><<tiredness 2>><<if ($mpClockLamp or 0) lte 0>><<pain 2>><<stress 3>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回机括城 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><</link>>

:: MP Region Druid Stones Chain [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpSeenScenes to ($mpSeenScenes or {})>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Druid Stones Chain"] to 1>><<set $mpDruidChainDone to ($mpDruidChainDone or {})>><<if $mpDruidLamp is undefined>><<set $mpDruidLamp to 2>><</if>><<set $mpDruidLamp to Math.clamp($mpDruidLamp, 0, 5)>>
你踏过石柱群外缘那块刻着星位的青石板，脚下活水暗槽咔嗒下沉，冷泉随即漫过身后的腐殖泥径，来路转眼没入深水。北面最高的花岗岩柱身豁着一道窄缝，青铜祭祀短镰的弧形刃口正从缝里探出；前方白石水池的泉眼旁则开着双生银丝花。<<if ($mpDruidLamp or 0) lte 0>>松脂风灯已经断油，雾气里只能靠水声辨认石柱的间距。<<else>>风灯照亮了石柱间的槲寄生麻绳与池畔的白石槽。<</if>><<if ($mpDruidDepth or 0) gte 2>>你已走到月泉内圈，寒气顺着裤管往上钻。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[细看石板星纹 (0:09)|MP Region Druid Stones Well]]>><<pass 9>><<set $mpDruidLamp to Math.max(0, ($mpDruidLamp or 0) - 1)>><<set $mpDruidDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpDruidDepth or 0) + 1)>><<set $mpDruidAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpDruidAlert or 0) + 1)>><<set $mpDruidStonesSeen to 1>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($athletics or 0) gte 260>>
<<mpherbicon>><<link [[踩浅滩石墩过月泉 (0:06)|MP Region Druid Stones Well]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpDruidDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpDruidDepth or 0) + 1)>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<mpdiveicon>><<link [[跨湿苔石垄 (0:06)|MP Region Druid Stones Mire]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpDruidDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpDruidDepth or 0) + 1)>><<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<lowerwet 30>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Druid Stones Mire [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
腐殖土下的青苔滑得像抹了脂膏。你左脚刚踏上石垄，整块泥皮便塌进冰冷的泉沟，手肘磕在卧牛石棱角上，泥水一直漫过膝盖。身后的青石板早已被涨起的暗泉淹没，退不回池口；古橡树顶端的渡鸦旧巢被惊动，扑棱棱飞起一片黑影。<<if ($mpDruidLamp or 0) lte 0>>风灯灭在冷水里，你只能摸着石柱上的螺旋转槽往外爬。<<else>>你把风灯举过水面，火苗在林雾里抖个不停。<</if>><<if ($mpDruidAlert or 0) gte 6>>林缘响起两声短促的银鹰哨，巡林人正往石阵赶来。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[攀卧牛石脱身 (0:07)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><<tiredness 2>><<stress 3>><<lowerwet 25>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpsneakicon>><<link [[钻古橡树根撤石阵 (0:06)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><<tiredness 3>><<stress 2>><<lowerwet 20>><</link>>

:: MP Region Druid Stones Well [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpDruidChainDone to ($mpDruidChainDone or {})>>
白石月井的出水槽里卡着一枚温润玉蝉，池畔石龛搁着一罐凝结的松脂灯膏，正北裂石缝里夹着缠草绳的青铜祭祀短镰，石案下还压着一张绘有古根水脉的星辰桦皮图。<<if $mpDruidChainDone["stones"]>>月井四周的器物都已取走，只余清泉漫过蝉翼的潺潺水声。<<elseif $mpDruidStonesSeen>>你先前认准了星辰石板的走势，踩着干石墩稳稳落脚。<<else>>你急匆匆蹚过浅水，冰凉的泉沫溅湿了衣摆。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回古石环 (0:05)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<if !$mpDruidChainDone["stones"]>>
<<mplampicon>><<link [[刮取松脂灯膏 (0:06)|MP Region Druid Stones Exit]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpDruidStonesPick to "oil">><<set $mpDruidLoot_Oil to 1>><<set $mpDruidLamp to Math.min(5, ($mpDruidLamp or 0) + 2)>><<stress -2>><<set $mpDruidChainDone["stones"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpknifeicon>><<link [[拔出裂石青铜短镰 (0:08)|MP Region Druid Stones Exit]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpDruidStonesPick to "sickle">><<set $mpDruidAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpDruidAlert or 0) + 2)>><<set $mpDruidBronzeSickle to 1>><<skulduggery 2>><<stress -2>><<set $mpDruidChainDone["stones"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpmapicon>><<link [[收星辰水脉桦图 (0:06)|MP Region Druid Stones Exit]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpDruidStonesPick to "chart">><<set $mpDruidStarChart to 1>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["druid_star_chart"] to 1>><<stress -2>><<set $mpDruidChainDone["stones"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<else>>
<<link [[返古石环 (0:04)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Druid Stones Exit [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你绕到月泉祭坛后方的古橡树洞旁，来时的青石板仍浸在活水底下，唯有树洞骨铃暗径与白石排水槽能绕回外围。<<if $mpDruidStonesPick is "oil">>风灯添上凝脂松膏，火苗透出清冽的松香。<<elseif $mpDruidStonesPick is "sickle">>青铜祭祀短镰收在腰间皮套里，弧刃泛着冷光。<<else>>星辰水脉桦皮图折好揣进怀里，暗渠的深浅已记熟。<</if>><<if ($mpDruidLamp or 0) lte 0>>林雾里没了一丝灯火，你把手搭在白石排水槽的沿口，数着石缝一步步摸回外圈。<<elseif ($upperwet or 0) gte 30 or ($lowerwet or 0) gte 30>>湿透的裤管贴着小腿，夜风一吹寒意刺骨。<</if>><<if ($mpDruidAlert or 0) gte 6>>石阵外围晃动着火把，巡林人正牵着猎犬查看脚印。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[穿骨铃树洞回池 (0:05)|MP Region Pool Druid]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><<if ($mpDruidAlert or 0) gte 6>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<set $mpDruidAlert to Math.max(0, ($mpDruidAlert or 0) - 1)>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpropeicon>><<link [[攀白石排水槽下撤 (0:07)|MP Region Pool Druid]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><<tiredness 2>><<if ($mpDruidLamp or 0) lte 0>><<pain 2>><<stress 3>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返古石环 (0:04)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><</link>>

:: MP Region Druid Rootcave Chain [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpSeenScenes to ($mpSeenScenes or {})>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Druid Rootcave Chain"] to 1>><<set $mpDruidChainDone to ($mpDruidChainDone or {})>>
千年橡树盘结成的古根地穴分出上下两条去路：东侧泥壁下袒露着半截石砌暗渠，挪开长满绿藓的青铜圆盾就能涉水钻进去，只是渠水冰冷刺骨；上层穹顶盘绕着粗大苍白树根，根须交汇处托着一颗微光萤石球，顺根须攀爬不会沾水，却极易震落枯枝惊动林间耳目。<<if $mpDruidStarChart>>怀里的星辰桦皮图恰好标出了暗渠底部的干石梁。<<else>>地穴深处水声回荡，摸不清泥坑深浅。<</if>><<if ($mpDruidDepth or 0) gte 2>>你已深入地脉腹地，空气里满是湿泥与草药气味。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回德鲁伊池 (0:03)|MP Region Pool Druid]]>><<pass 3>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 260 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>
<<mpswimicon>><<link [[挪开铜盾涉暗渠 (0:07)|MP Region Druid Rootcave Hollow]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpDruidRootRoute to "canal">><<set $mpDruidDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpDruidDepth or 0) + 1)>><<set $mpDruidLamp to Math.max(0, ($mpDruidLamp or 0) - 1)>><<lowerwet 20>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<mpdiveicon>><<link [[暗渠失足落水 (0:07)|MP Region Druid Rootcave Collapse]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpDruidDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpDruidDepth or 0) + 1)>><<lowerwet 35>><<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<mpclimbicon>><<link [[攀苍白树根穹顶入 (0:06)|MP Region Druid Rootcave Hollow]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpDruidRootRoute to "roots">><<set $mpDruidDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpDruidDepth or 0) + 1)>><<set $mpDruidAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpDruidAlert or 0) + 2)>><<pain 3>><<tiredness 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[退回石环 (0:04)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><</link>>

:: MP Region Druid Rootcave Collapse [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
泥坡下的腐殖空腔突然塌陷，你抓向头顶的树根网兜，枯藤却啪地绷断，整个人滑进刺骨的暗渠泥潭。泥浆裹住了双腿，陶片擦破手掌，前方通往石台的窄洞被落石堵死，只能从侧壁裂隙往外爬。<<if ($mpDruidLamp or 0) lte 0>>风灯早在滑落时熄灭，你只能摸着苍白树根辨认出口。<<else>>灯罩糊满了黑泥，只透出豆大的一点微光。<</if>><<if ($mpDruidAlert or 0) gte 6>>地穴口传来猎犬的刨土声与低吠。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[顺泥壁退回池口 (0:06)|MP Region Pool Druid]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpclimbicon>><<link [[攀树根裂隙回石环 (0:07)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><<pain 1>><<tiredness 2>><</link>>

:: MP Region Druid Rootcave Hollow [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpDruidChainDone to ($mpDruidChainDone or {})>>
<<if $mpDruidRootRoute is "canal">>你从铜盾暗渠钻出，裤管滴着冷水，正好站在地穴深处的石台下。<<else>>你顺着穹顶苍白树根翻落石台，手掌被粗树皮磨得生疼，要把陶瓮搬下高架还得费一番气力。<</if>>石台上排着五只泥封陶瓮，中间一瓮插着白羽；北壁树根网兜里则悬着一只红蜡封口的风干药葫芦。<<if $mpDruidChainDone["rootcave"]>>陶瓮与药葫芦都已动过，只余穹顶萤石球的幽光。<<elseif ($mpDruidLamp or 0) lte 0>>灯油已尽，你只能借着萤石微光摸索泥封。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[空手退回池 (0:04)|MP Region Pool Druid]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<if !$mpDruidChainDone["rootcave"]>>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[抱走白羽泥封陶瓮 (0:09)|MP Region Druid Rootcave Exit]]>><<pass 9>><<set $mpDruidRootPick to "heavy">><<if $mpDruidRootRoute is "canal">><<set $mpDruidAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpDruidAlert or 0) + 3)>><<tiredness 3>><<else>><<set $mpDruidAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpDruidAlert or 0) + 2)>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("druid_chain_rootcave_heavy")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><<money 350>><<stress -2>><</if>><<set $mpDruidChainDone["rootcave"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpreadicon>><<link [[割取葫芦草药方 (0:06)|MP Region Druid Rootcave Exit]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpDruidRootPick to "light">><<if $mpDruidRootRoute is "roots">><<set $mpDruidAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpDruidAlert or 0) + 2)>><<lowerwet 25>><<else>><<set $mpDruidAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpDruidAlert or 0) + 1)>><</if>><<if !$mpDruidHerbRecipe>><<set $mpDruidHerbRecipe to 1>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["druid_root_recipe"] to 1>><<stress -3>><<willpower 1>><</if>><<set $mpDruidChainDone["rootcave"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<</if>>
<<walkicon>><<link [[钻树洞回石环 (0:05)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><</link>>

:: MP Region Druid Rootcave Exit [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
地脉暗渠的冷水正沿着石壁缓缓上涨，漫过青铜圆盾长满绿藓的底座，地穴主道与树根通风竖井各通往一处出口。<<if $mpDruidRootPick is "heavy">>白羽陶瓮沉甸甸地压在臂弯里，泥封里透出陈年秘药的苦香。<<else>>草药古方妥善收进内袋，风干葫芦仍挂在网兜里。<</if>><<if ($mpDruidLamp or 0) lte 0>>黑暗里没有灯照，你侧耳听暗渠滴水的回声辨别方向，踩着干石梁往外走。<<elseif ($upperwet or 0) gte 30 or ($lowerwet or 0) gte 30>>湿透的衣衫粘着腐叶，林间穿堂风吹得人直打寒噤。<</if>><<if ($mpDruidAlert or 0) gte 6>>洞口上方传来猎犬的喘息声，有人正拿火把往地穴里照。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[顺主道退回池 (0:06)|MP Region Pool Druid]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><<if $mpDruidRootPick is "heavy">><<tiredness 2>><<stress 2>><</if>><<if ($mpDruidAlert or 0) gte 6>><<stress 3>><<set $mpDruidAlert to Math.max(0, ($mpDruidAlert or 0) - 1)>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpswimicon>><<link [[潜暗渠水洞险渡 (0:08)|MP Region Pool Druid]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><<if $mpDruidRootPick is "heavy" or ($mpDruidLamp or 0) lte 0>><<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<lowerwet 25>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回古石环 (0:05)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><</link>>

:: MP Region Druid Watchtower Chain [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpSeenScenes to ($mpSeenScenes or {})>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Druid Watchtower Chain"] to 1>><<set $mpDruidChainDone to ($mpDruidChainDone or {})>>
老橡树粗壮的枝杈间架着一座木制瞭望台，二楼窗框缠着纯银鹰哨，顶层栏杆钉着防风信鸽笼。木梯半腰坐着一名披灰斗篷的巡林哨兵，正给猎刀抹油，听见动静头也不抬：「夜里狼群围着石环转，没带水脉图或巡林信物的一律不准上塔。」<<if ($mpDruidLamp or 0) lte 0>>你的风灯已经断油，树冠阴影里只有哨兵脚边那一豆火光。<<else>>灯光映出二楼墙上的巨型狼皮与柴火堆后的铁盒。<</if>><<if ($mpDruidDepth or 0) gte 2>>你已攀至林冠中层，脚下松涛与远处狼嚎此起彼伏。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回德鲁伊池 (0:03)|MP Region Pool Druid]]>><<pass 3>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpDruidStarChart or (($mpDruidLamp or 0) gte 1 and (($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 340)) or (($tending or 0) gte 360 and ($willpower or 0) gte 540)>>
<<mpanimalicon>><<link [[亮星纹图登塔 (0:07)|MP Region Druid Watchtower Loft]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpDruidDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpDruidDepth or 0) + 1)>><<set $mpDruidTowerEntry to "pass">><<tiredness 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<link [[上前请求借道看 (0:07)|MP Region Druid Watchtower Howl]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpDruidDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpDruidDepth or 0) + 1)>><<set $mpDruidAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpDruidAlert or 0) + 1)>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<mpsneakicon>><<link [[借浓雾攀外侧树藤 (0:08)|MP Region Druid Watchtower Loft]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpDruidDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpDruidDepth or 0) + 1)>><<set $mpDruidAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpDruidAlert or 0) + 3)>><<set $mpDruidTowerEntry to "sneak">><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返古石环 (0:04)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><</link>>

:: MP Region Druid Watchtower Howl [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你刚踏上木梯第三格，巡林哨兵便按住刀柄站起身，摘下窗框边的银鹰哨吹出一记短音：「林子里生人勿留，趁狼群还没合围，赶紧下树。」他单手提灯将你送下木梯，反手挂上了底层铁链闩，顶层的望远镜与信鸽笼连边都摸不着。<<if ($mpDruidLamp or 0) lte 0>>手里没灯，你只能扶着潮湿的树干退回林间空地。<<else>>哨兵替你拨正灯罩，示意你莫在塔下逗留。<</if>><<if ($mpDruidAlert or 0) gte 6>>远处灌木丛里亮起几双幽绿的狼眼。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[下木梯退回池 (0:05)|MP Region Pool Druid]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpsneakicon>><<link [[顺猎道小径回石环 (0:07)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><</link>>

:: MP Region Druid Watchtower Loft [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpDruidChainDone to ($mpDruidChainDone or {})>>
瞭望台顶层架着黄铜单筒望远镜，栏杆边钉着防风信鸽笼，底层柴堆后的铁皮盒与狼皮后的暗砖都缠着三道浸油麻绳。<<if $mpDruidTowerEntry is "sneak">>塔下传来哨兵添柴的低响，他并未察觉有人从外侧树藤翻上了顶层。<<else>>哨兵在二楼值班室里歇脚，任由你在顶层平台察看。<</if>><<if $mpDruidBronzeSickle>>腰间的青铜短镰一挑，浸油麻绳便无声断开。<<else>>手头没有利刃，硬解死扣时木百叶合页发出一串轻响。<</if>><<if $mpDruidChainDone["watchtower"]>>鸽笼底板与铁盒都已翻看，只剩山风吹动木百叶。<<else>>你可以拨转铜风标并吹响银鹰哨引开外围狼群，也可以只抽走鸽笼底板下的换哨排班图。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回德鲁伊池 (0:04)|MP Region Pool Druid]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<if !$mpDruidChainDone["watchtower"]>>
<<mpbellicon>><<link [[吹银鹰哨引开狼群 (0:08)|MP Region Druid Watchtower Exit]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpDruidTowerPick to "whistle">><<set $mpDruidAlert to Math.max(0, ($mpDruidAlert or 0) - 2)>><<if !$mpDruidWolvesDiverted>><<set $mpDruidWolvesDiverted to 1>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["druid_wolves_diverted"] to 1>><<stress -4>><<willpower 2>><</if>><<set $mpDruidChainDone["watchtower"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpsneakicon>><<link [[抽走鸽笼排班图 (0:08)|MP Region Druid Watchtower Exit]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpDruidTowerPick to "roster">><<if !$mpDruidBronzeSickle>><<set $mpDruidAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpDruidAlert or 0) + 2)>><</if>><<if !$mpDruidPatrolRoster>><<set $mpDruidPatrolRoster to 1>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["druid_patrol_roster"] to 1>><<skulduggery 2>><<stress -3>><</if>><<set $mpDruidChainDone["watchtower"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<</if>>
<<walkicon>><<link [[下塔回石环 (0:05)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><</link>>

:: MP Region Druid Watchtower Exit [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
林冠高处的凛冽夜风吹得防风信鸽笼轻轻摇晃，木梯主道与树冠分叉处垂下的猎人麻绳都能回到地面。<<if $mpDruidTowerPick is "whistle">>清越的鹰哨声传遍深林，外围游荡的狼群纷纷向荒原方向退去。<<else>>换哨排班图与防潮火柴收进衣袋，木百叶原样合拢。<</if>><<if ($mpDruidLamp or 0) lte 0>>下塔没有灯火，你攥住垂下来的老树根当扶手，一级一级蹭下湿滑的木梯。<<elseif ($upperwet or 0) gte 30 or ($lowerwet or 0) gte 30>>高处的山风吹透湿衣，冻得人手指发僵。<</if>><<if ($mpDruidAlert or 0) gte 6>>树根下亮起巡林火把，哨兵正抬头盘查塔上动静。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[下木梯回池 (0:05)|MP Region Pool Druid]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><<if ($mpDruidAlert or 0) gte 6>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<set $mpDruidAlert to Math.max(0, ($mpDruidAlert or 0) - 1)>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpropeicon>><<link [[顺树冠藤索滑下 (0:07)|MP Region Pool Druid]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><<tiredness 2>><<if ($mpDruidLamp or 0) lte 0>><<pain 2>><<stress 3>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返古石环 (0:04)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><</link>>

:: MP Region Druid Altar Chain [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpSeenScenes to ($mpSeenScenes or {})>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Druid Altar Chain"] to 1>><<set $mpDruidChainDone to ($mpDruidChainDone or {})>>
石环最深处的半圆形石案旁，一对风化石柱牵着粗麻绳，绳身缠满干枯槲寄生，绳结垂着一只小皮囊；案上摆着残留琥珀蜜酒的三足青铜爵，一头通体雪白牡鹿正隔着薄雾静立凝望。<<if $mpDruidBronzeSickle>>腰间的青铜短镰正好能安静挑开槲寄生绳结。<<else>>手头没有利刃，只能硬扯开缠满槲寄生的麻绳。<</if>><<if ($mpDruidAlert or 0) gte 6>>周围林地警觉已高，狼吠与哨音惊得白鹿频频刨蹄，你已来不及屏息慢靠近前。<<elseif ($mpDruidLamp or 0) lte 0>>灯油见底，麻绳上的兽骨风铃在暗处难以辨认。<</if>><<if ($mpDruidDepth or 0) gte 2>>你已踏入古祭坛核心，四周松涛完全静止。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回德鲁伊池 (0:03)|MP Region Pool Druid]]>><<pass 3>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($mpDruidAlert or 0) lt 6>>
<<if (($mpDruidLamp or 0) gte 1 and (($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 240)) or (($tending or 0) gte 380 and ($history or 0) gte 360)>>
<<mpritualicon>><<link [[屏息近白鹿石案 (0:07)|MP Region Druid Altar Shrine]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpDruidDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpDruidDepth or 0) + 1)>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<mpsneakicon>><<link [[碰响兽骨铃 (0:07)|MP Region Druid Altar Mist]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpDruidDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpDruidDepth or 0) + 1)>><<set $mpDruidAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpDruidAlert or 0) + 2)>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>
<</if>>
<<mpknifeicon>><<link [[拨开槲寄生麻绳网 (0:07)|MP Region Druid Altar Shrine]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpDruidDepth to Math.min(3, ($mpDruidDepth or 0) + 1)>><<if $mpDruidBronzeSickle>><<set $mpDruidAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpDruidAlert or 0) + 1)>><<tiredness 1>><<else>><<set $mpDruidAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpDruidAlert or 0) + 3)>><<pain 1>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返古石环 (0:04)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><</link>>

:: MP Region Druid Altar Mist [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你的肩头撞响了树洞下悬挂的兽骨风铃，清脆骨音在寂静林间炸开。石案旁的白鹿受惊跃入浓雾，枝头的渡鸦群齐声嘶鸣，翻涌的白雾瞬间将石案与内环遮得严严实实。林外很快传来急促的猎犬吠声，你只能趁合围前撤出祭坛。<<if ($mpDruidLamp or 0) lte 0>>黑暗里分不清石柱方位，手背被荆棘划出几道血痕。<<else>>风灯在浓雾里只照得见脚下半尺湿苔。<</if>><<if ($mpDruidAlert or 0) gte 6>>两名巡林人已举着火把逼近外圈石柱。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[顺风化石柱回石环 (0:07)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpsneakicon>><<link [[钻灌木丛回池口 (0:06)|MP Region Pool Druid]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<lowerwet 15>><</link>>

:: MP Region Druid Altar Shrine [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpDruidChainDone to ($mpDruidChainDone or {})>>
半圆形石案上摆着三足青铜爵，爵底干涸的琥珀蜜酒下压着一片刻满古酿配比的薄铜片，旁边的槲寄生皮囊里装着几枚古银币与绿松石剑柄残件。<<if $mpDruidChainDone["altar"]>>石案上的器物已被你处置妥当，白鹿留下的蹄印在湿苔上清晰可见。<<elseif ($mpDruidLamp or 0) lte 0>>灯油告罄，薄铜片上的细密古字模糊不清，只能凭手感摸索。<</if>><<if ($mpDruidLamp or 0) gte 1 and !$mpDruidChainDone["altar"]>>借着风灯微光，你看清了铜爵底部的林间盟约铭文。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回德鲁伊池 (0:04)|MP Region Pool Druid]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<if !$mpDruidChainDone["altar"]>>
<<if ($mpDruidLamp or 0) gte 1>>
<<mphearticon>><<link [[留存铜爵记铭文 (0:07)|MP Region Druid Altar Exit]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpDruidAltarPick to "leave">><<set $mpDruidAlert to Math.max(0, ($mpDruidAlert or 0) - 1)>><<if !$mpDruidAltarChoice>><<set $mpDruidAltarChoice to "leave">><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["druid_altar_vow"] to 1>><<stress -5>><<willpower 2>><</if>><<set $mpDruidChainDone["altar"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<</if>>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[带走青铜爵与银币 (0:07)|MP Region Druid Altar Exit]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpDruidAltarPick to "take">><<set $mpDruidAlert to Math.min(10, ($mpDruidAlert or 0) + 2)>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("druid_chain_altar_relic")>><<set $mpDruidAltarChoice to "take">><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><<money 400>><<stress -2>><</if>><<set $mpDruidChainDone["altar"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<</if>>
<<walkicon>><<link [[出坛回石环 (0:05)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><</link>>

:: MP Region Druid Altar Exit [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
深林湿冷的夜雾重新合拢在半圆形石案四周，卧牛石主径与槲寄生缠绕的林隙都能退回石环外围。<<if $mpDruidAltarPick is "leave">>你将三足青铜爵原样放回石案，白鹿在雾中朝你轻轻颔首后隐入林海。<<else>>青铜爵与古银币贴身收好，树洞里的兽骨风铃随风轻响。<</if>><<if ($mpDruidLamp or 0) lte 0>>回程没有灯火，你面朝石案沿祭坛台阶倒退，脚跟探到平地才敢转身。<<elseif ($upperwet or 0) gte 30 or ($lowerwet or 0) gte 30>>湿冷的裤脚沾满草籽，寒风吹得人脊背发凉。<</if>><<if ($mpDruidAlert or 0) gte 6>>石阵出口火光晃动，巡林哨兵正守在苔径前盘查。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[顺苔径退回池 (0:05)|MP Region Pool Druid]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><<if ($mpDruidAlert or 0) gte 6>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<set $mpDruidAlert to Math.max(0, ($mpDruidAlert or 0) - 1)>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpclimbicon>><<link [[翻卧牛石坡险路撤 (0:07)|MP Region Pool Druid]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><<tiredness 2>><<if ($mpDruidLamp or 0) lte 0>><<pain 2>><<stress 3>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返古石环 (0:04)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><</link>>
